      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Concept ACK b40ac85. With this PR, the v0 branch of `AddInput` clears every field that `PSBTInput::HasSignatures` checks, plus the MuSig2 public nonces. [btclib-wallet](https://github.com/btclib-org/btclib-wallet/blob/22ee823a4dd5377b37d7b5f3dc1fc54408b28f83/src/btclib_wallet/psbt/psbt.py#L3896-L3912), which I maintain, clears the same seven fields when it joins v0 PSBTs. I ran this PR's test scenario through it: no joined input keeps a key-path signature, and the joined PSBT signs both inputs again.\n",
